      data:
        m_KeyId: 2151321012158465
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: The text the map shows. Aleph One draws it on one line, in Mac Roman.
    - rid: 552786097007231816
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 2151321012158466
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: Its annotation style. Aleph One has one (0), and its map doesn't draw an annotation of another type.
    - rid: 552786097007231817
